#: templates/dash.html:11
msgid ""
"This is where packagers can monitor the status of automatic tests (CI) and "
"ongoing major pull requests accross all apps. If you want to get started "
"with app packaging in YunoHost, please check out the <a class='text-"
"blue-500' href='https://doc.yunohost.org/dev/packaging/'>packaging "
"documentation</a> and come say hi to us on the <a class='text-blue-500' "
"href='https://doc.yunohost.org/community/chat_rooms/'>app packaging "
"chatroom</a>!"
msgstr ""
"Paketleyiciler, buradan tüm uygulamalar genelinde otomatik testlerin (CI) "
"durumunu ve devam eden önemli pull isteklerini takip edebilirler. "
"YunoHost'ta uygulama paketlemeye başlamak istiyorsanız, lütfen <a class"
"='text-blue-500' href='https://doc.yunohost.org/dev/packaging/'>paketleme "
"belgelerine</a> göz atın ve <a class='text-blue-500' href='https://"
"doc.yunohost.org/community/chat_rooms/'>uygulama paketleme sohbet odasına</"
"a> gelip bize merhaba deyin!"

